<title>PUERTO RICO: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>PUERTO RICO GOVERNMENT LIST (961106)</p>
<p> Governor.......................................Pedro ROSSELLO</p>
<p>(Inaugurated 2 January 1993, re-elected 5 Nov 96)</p>
<p>				   - - - - -</p>
<p>SECRETARIES:</p>
<p> Agriculture......................................Neftali SOTO</p>
<p> Consumer Affairs..................................Jose ALICEA</p>
<p> Correction &amp; Rehabilitation.......................Nydia COTTO</p>
<p> Economic &amp; Commercial Development................Luis FORTUNO</p>
<p> Family..........................................Carmen RIVERA</p>
<p> Health.......................................Carmen FELICIANO</p>
<p> Housing.........................................Carlos VIVONI</p>
<p> Justice..................................Gen. Pedro PIERLUISI</p>
<p> Labour &amp; Human Resources......................Cesar ALMODOVAR</p>
<p> Natural &amp; Environmental Resources..............Pedro GELABERT</p>
<p> Recreation &amp; Sports.............................Eric LABRADOR</p>
<p> State............................................Norma BURGOS</p>
<p>  (Also Chmn of Planning Board)</p>
<p> Transportation &amp; Public Works.................Carlos PESQUERA</p>
<p> Treasury..................................Manuel DIAZ-SALDANA</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>OTHER DEPARTMENTS:</p>
